      "id": "evt_gcal_com_verci_f769274d",
      "name": "Happy Birthday Verci!!",
      "type": "technology",
      "locationId": "",
      "communityId": "com_verci",
      "description": "GUYSSSSS COME TO VERCI'S BIRTHDAY PARTY!!!\nWe're celebrating Verci's fourth birthday the only way we know how: chartering a boat to Red Hook for a night at the Red Hook Pinball Museum.\n\nMeet at Verci at 6:45pm (or Stuyvesant Cove at 7:15pm) to catch the water taxi! Red Hook Pinball Museum at 8pm.\nExpect birthday cake, party hats, party favors, drinks, and unlimited pinball as we take over one of the coolest spots evah. Then we'll end the night exploring Red Hook with a little birthday bar crawl.\nWe'll have everything you need to celebrate Verci turning FOUR YEARS OLD!\nSee you there!!! \u2764\ufe0f",
